  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Collision between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9f2f0bb6-b1b0-483b-9f52-1e922d875091-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 80px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> (from momentum conservation)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Collision between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fbcbd845-05b2-475e-9cb4-323991f3718a-image.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 81px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></math> (from momentum conservation)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
